                      (    forth6809.asm):04575         
DA1C                  (    forth6809.asm):04576         ADONE:
                      (    forth6809.asm):04577                     IFEQ  SERIALPOLL        ; >>>>>>>>>>  interrupt-driven build: nothing
                      (    forth6809.asm):04578                                             ; extra needed, see ACCEPT's entry above
