                      (    forth6809.asm):04997         ; address).
                      (    forth6809.asm):04998         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
DC6A EC62             (    forth6809.asm):04999         IW:         LDD   2,S               ; n. See bugfix: IW.1
DC6C 3606             (    forth6809.asm):05000                     PSHU  D
