DF07 3606             (    forth6809.asm):05486                     PSHU  D
DF09 BDDA80           (    forth6809.asm):05487                     JSR   THROWW
DF0C BDDEC8           (    forth6809.asm):05488         BTOK:       JSR   LITERALW
