DFC3 3606             (    forth6809.asm):05613                     PSHU  D                 ; char
DFC5 39               (    forth6809.asm):05614                     RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):05615         
                      (    forth6809.asm):05616         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
                      (    forth6809.asm):05617         ; >IN  ( -- a-addr )
