F0CB 26EF             (    forth6809.asm):08816                     BNE   SPLOOP
F0CD 3342             (    forth6809.asm):08817         SPDONE:     LEAU  2,U               ; drop n
F0CF 39               (    forth6809.asm):08818                     RTS
